      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This only looks good on paper...\nThe Android and PC (Windows) platform are completely different meaning stuff compiled for Android can only be seen on Android, and the same thing goes for PC (Windows) stuff compiled to PC can only be seen on PC's. \nJust as an example if someone were to upload their Quest avatar only to Android and didn't bother uploading a PC version then nobody on PC would be able to see the avatar. Same thing goes for worlds.\nIt'd be impossible to load a file compiled for Android on PC and the same goes for Android where files compiled to Windows can't be used on Android.",
      "viewerReactions": null
